      "text": "After breakfast, spend the day exploring Gramado on a private full-day tour: discover the town’s highlights and enjoy its distinctive atmosphere, surrounded by the lush landscapes of the Serra Gaúcha.\n\nAt the end of the tour, continue by private vehicle with your English-speaking guide to Cambará do Sul, a spectacular destination known for its dramatic canyons and unspoiled natural scenery. Check in at your hotel for the next three nights.\n\nBreakfast",
